  "title": "Spicy Red Snapper (Bloody Mary with Gin)",
  "description": "I&#39;ve tried many variations, and decided that these ingredients make the very best Red Snapper out there. It is now my go-to drink, and friends absolutely love it - even those who don&#39;t like gin. Careful! Your lips might burn, but it sure goes down easy!",
